The '''Dive Ghast''' is a [[Ghast]] type [[Mob]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Dive Ghasts''' spawn in {{Zone|The Wasteland}} at Night near the {{zone|Forgotten Skull}}. (7 P.M. - 6 A.M. [[SkyBlock Time]]) 

== Behavior ==
Unlike normal Ghasts, '''Dive Ghasts''' do not shoot fireballs at the player. They make multiple igniting sounds, with particles appearing over them, before quickly flying towards the player and exploding, dealing {{Stat|dmg|10,000}} if they hit the player. With a {{Item|Netherrack-Looking Sunshade}}, Dive Ghasts are passive.

